Package: ssh-tunnel-manager
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: caiqianzhang <caiqianzhang@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: openssh-client
Recommends: sshpass
Description: SSH tunnel manager with a DDNS fast-path (SSH 隧道管理器)
 Tray application that manages SSH local/remote port forwards through
 a plain ssh process (known_hosts/agent keep working). With Baidu
 Cloud DNS credentials (baidu.key, optional) the server IP is resolved
 authoritatively on connect and a heartbeat restarts the tunnel when
 the IP changes; without it a configurable public DNS server is used
 as the fallback resolver. Config lives in
 ~/.config/ssh-tunnel-manager/, SSH passwords are stored
 AES-256-GCM-encrypted.
